WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,170
Secretary

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:03,220
starting from today

3
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:05,340
I, Li Qingshan, voluntarily sever all ties with Li Jiaren

4
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:06,620
From now on, whether I am born, old, sick or dead,

5
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:07,820
It has nothing to do with Li Jiaren

6
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,180
I don’t want Li Jia’s house or land.

7
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,100
But I had to give me the money I paid to buy Sha Yufu before.

8
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,780
Li Songshi no longer has anything to do with me

9
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,140
I don’t care about his pension anymore.

10
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:26,410
Lao Fan, please help me to be a witness and write a few words. Please sign it, Mr. Li Song.

11
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:28,400
I raised him so big

12
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,560
If he says to sever the relationship, sever the relationship.

13
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:31,720
You want me to sign it

14
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,360
You must give me a monthly pension

15
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,080
That Sha Yufu originally belonged to our Li Jia

16
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,560
If Li Qingshan doesn’t give it to us, forget it.

17
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:37,880
They actually want us to pay

18
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,000
It's simply anti-Tiangang

19
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:39,920
Not signing, right?

20
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,520
sign we sign

21
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:47,230
I don't have that much cash on hand right now

22
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:48,310
me too

23
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:50,550
It’s so simple to not be able to take out so much at once

24
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,110
If you don’t have money, you can issue an IOU now.

25
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:53,630
Calculate interest based on bank interest rate

26
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:55,110
Press first printing and write the date

27
00:00:55,110 --> 00:00:56,150
If you fail to pay the principal at maturity, you will receive interest.

28
00:00:56,150 --> 00:00:57,510
Pay off even a penny difference

29
00:00:57,510 --> 00:00:59,350
Just talk to the gun in my hand
